{"id":"impresio_n","lemma":"impresión","pos":"noun","rank":1618,"glosses":["impression","print","shock"],"ipa":"/impɾeˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"impresiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-impresi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es su impresión, doctor?","en":"What's your impression, doctor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77996","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"doctor"}]},{"text":"¿Te di esa impresión?","en":"Did I give you that impression?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586522","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"Used as a friendly…"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"Ésa es también mi impresión.","en":"That's my feeling as well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/605051","words":[{"g":"that one","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"also, too, as well"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Tengo la impresión de que conoce el secreto.","en":"I have the impression that he knows the secret.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531758","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"a secret"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that"]]},{"text":"Quiero dar una buena impresión.","en":"I want to make a good impression.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]}]}